    <li>We may change, add or remove features over time.</li>
    <li>To the extent the law allows, Skyderby is not liable for indirect damages or losses from using the service. Nothing in these terms limits rights you have under consumer protection law.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update these terms. We'll change the date at the top, and for important changes we'll let you know. If you keep using Skyderby after that, the new terms apply.</p>

